on the table.


00:03:20.969 --> 00:03:22.834
Thank you.


00:03:22.871 --> 00:03:24.463
Thank you.


00:03:24.506 --> 00:03:26.474
Promise me you're not
gonna leave, all right?


00:03:26.508 --> 00:03:29.204
You're not gonna take off
when they put me under.


00:03:29.244 --> 00:03:31.144
