- Come on.


00:04:51.459 --> 00:04:54.326
The brace.


00:04:56.064 --> 00:04:58.032
You're awesome.


00:04:58.066 --> 00:05:00.364
- l love you. Be careful.
- Love you. Thank you.


00:05:00.402 --> 00:05:02.165
- l'll be right up.
- All right.


00:05:09.644 --> 00:05:11.635
( kissing )


00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:13.671
